WEBVTT

00:07:58.141 --> 00:08:01.811
around where you might have first
adapted or learned this.

00:08:02.379 --> 00:08:05.315
When it might have helped
or protected you in life.

00:08:06.016 --> 00:08:08.084
Did you learn early on
you had to be perfect

00:08:08.118 --> 00:08:10.053
to avoid shame or discipline?

00:08:11.454 --> 00:08:13.623
Or when you were young,

00:08:13.656 --> 00:08:16.192
did you learn you had to be
overly self-reliant,

00:08:16.226 --> 00:08:18.428
you had to take care
of everything and everyone

00:08:18.461 --> 00:08:20.063
because your caretaker couldn't.

00:08:21.264 --> 00:08:23.767
Or maybe later in life,

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:24.968
in college,

00:08:24.968 --> 00:08:27.737
did you learn it was worth sacrificing
whatever you needed

00:08:27.771 --> 00:08:30.373
to get that win or accolade,